{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家穿梭香港發掘各式驚喜美食！今次主持人分別深入旺角及大埔，一邊品嚐令人回味無窮的地道韓國菜，另一邊則挑戰性價比極高的平民酒樓美味小菜。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由張與辰帶著林映暉（暉哥）開展韓式美食尋味之旅，造訪張與辰個人最愛的韓國菜餐廳。這間餐廳最標誌性的靈魂所在，在於其自家調製、濃郁鹹香中帶微辣的醬油風味，惹味十足，獲得食客一致好評。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>鳳雛燉雞</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址</strong>：旺角彌敦道726號10樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c1401d88-9a10-476e-a75d-7df943d2fb45.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026TLiZEWXMus1791342769.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c1401d88-9a10-476e-a75d-7df943d2fb45.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9fd5b159-5c14-42c7-a162-ec2c7049375b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260OVF9ta5u21791342768.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9fd5b159-5c14-42c7-a162-ec2c7049375b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"36c4d46e-2dd3-4f89-928b-f49f7d33bc76.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260k1hNGXVZK1791342771.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"36c4d46e-2dd3-4f89-928b-f49f7d33bc76.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由何泳芍（Honey）與波波（黃婧靈）深入大埔一間高CP值的平民酒樓，品嚐多款價格親民、份量十足的驚喜菜式：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>大日子酒家</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址</strong>：大埔運頭街12-18號美華大廈地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f94d5c7-a4a4-4aa1-9dae-90df746d37af.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Id315hxKCv1791342771.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f94d5c7-a4a4-4aa1-9dae-90df746d37af.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cd8e5a6e-9419-481b-aa65-11f226943524.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dUgNp5cgu81791342770.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cd8e5a6e-9419-481b-aa65-11f226943524.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fc9bc7f9-3b6b-44ef-96fd-39e7ee97c47a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260yd0HmrwPa1791342770.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fc9bc7f9-3b6b-44ef-96fd-39e7ee97c47a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T13:20:54.775665+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}